---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Academic Projects" sideBarActiveItemID="academic">

    <div>
        <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5">Academic Projects</div>
    </div>
    <div>
        <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5">Master's Thesis</div>
    </div>
    <a class="text-blue-400 text-xl"
       href="https://www.pyxida.aueb.gr/files/612fe75d-c21c-490c-b4ca-e245f876867b/download/Chaniotaki_2022.pdf"
       target="_blank"><b>An Empirical Investigation of Boilerplate Code</b></a><br>
    <span class="font-light text-sm">Mar 2021 - Dec 2021</span><br>
    Investigation of the reasons for using boilerplate code. It includes an examination of previous research,
    tool-based code analysis, and a questionnaire survey.
    <br>
    Participants: Aggeliki Papadopoulou, George Liargovas, Zoe Kotti
    <br>
    Supervisor: Prof. Diomidis Spinellis

    <div class="divider my-5"></div>
    <div>
        <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5">Bachelor's Thesis</div>
    </div>

    <a class="text-blue-400 text-xl" href="/DNA.pdf"
       target="_blank">
        <b>DNA – Distributed Network Architecture</b></a><br>
    <span class="font-light text-sm">Jun 2017 - Apr 2018</span><br>
    <p class="pt-1"> Development of a Distributed Network that uses Android Smartphones to run server-side
        NodeJS code or plain Javascript Scripts.
        A library for Android applications, an API that handles all the jobs and a GUI for the users designed,
        implemented
        and developed.
        <br>
        Co-authored with Konstantinos Kopanidis.
        <br>
        Supervisors: Prof. Panos Louridas, Prof. George Xylomenos and Prof. Dimitris Mitropoulos.</p>


    <div class="divider my-5"></div>
    <div>
        <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5">Academic Projects</div>
    </div>

    <a class="text-blue-400 text-xl" href="https://github.com/Christina96/google-calendar-alexa-skill"
       target="_blank"><b>Google Calendar Alexa Skill</b></a><br>
    <span class="font-light text-sm">Apr 2017 - Jan 2018</span><br>
    <p class="pt-1"> An Alexa Skill for Amazon Echo by using Flask-Ask.
        With this skill you can connect your Public Google Calendar with your Amazon Echo and listen all your reminders
        or reminders for a specific day.
        <br>
        <i>Presented at Student Conference of the Department of Management Science and Technology, Athens University of
            Economics, Athens.</i></p>


</BaseLayout>
